Package: cudaembedr
Title: GPU-Aware Embeddings for R
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R:
    person("Yaoxiang", "Li", email = "liyaoxiang@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a common embedding interface for GPU-aware R workflows.
    Includes UMAP and t-SNE adapters, a diffusion-map-style embedding with
    optional CUDA distance computation, and adapters for cudaverse PCA and
    single-cell workflow results. Every result records its actual compute
    backend and source device.
